MID_LGV_1SEO_c11_Bon_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c11_Bon_m01_001: This is all rather frustrating.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c11_Bon_m01_002: For all my wisdom, I failed to foresee that Prince\nDyan could pose any threat.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c11_Bon_m01_003: Though I daresay his options for causing us grief\nare limited, even for a prince.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c11_Bon_m01_004: For now, I have instructed the chancellor to keep a\nclose eye on developments.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c11_Bon_m01: <BLN>How could I not have seen it?
MID_LGV_1SEO_c11_Tob_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c11_Tob_m01_001: Damn it! It's one problem after another. And just\nwhen we'd got your arm thing solved too.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c11_Tob_m01_002: Seriously, what's the deal? Haven't we been through\nenough at this point?
MID_LGV_1SEO_c11_Tob_m01_003: Wait... You don't think...
MID_LGV_1SEO_c11_Tob_m01_004: This isn't because I've been slacking on my prayers\nto Yu Phas, is it?
MID_LGA_1SEO_c11_Tob_m01: <BLN>What's the deal with all this?
MID_LGV_1SEO_c11_Lil_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c11_Lil_m01_001: Is it true that Prince Dyan escaped from Fort Cottus\nand went into hiding?
MID_LGV_1SEO_c11_Lil_m01_002: Don't get me wrong, I don't have any personal\nattachment to the guy.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c11_Lil_m01_003: But I worry that my parents might do something\ndumb like side with him again.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c11_Lil_m01_004: They always insisted that Prince Dyan was the only\none qualified to lead Saramis, after all...
MID_LGA_1SEO_c11_Lil_m01: <BLN>Is it true?!
MID_LGV_1SEO_c11_Lys_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c11_Lys_m01_001: Fort Cottus, where Prince Dyan was imprisoned,\nis a lone island far out at sea.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c11_Lys_m01_002: The currents surrounding it are turbulent. That's why\nno one has ever escaped from it before.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c11_Lys_m01_003: The sea only calms for a very short time each year...
MID_LGV_1SEO_c11_Lys_m01_004: My guess is that Prince Dyan still has his supporters\nin Saramis who helped him with the timing.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c11_Lys_m01: <BLN>Only one thing makes sense...
MID_LGV_1SEO_c11_Tro_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c11_Tro_m01_001: I do wish I could help you with this myself.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c11_Tro_m01_002: But circumstances elsewhere require me to support\na dear protégé of mine.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c11_Tro_m01: <BLN>I have my own troubles.